  "description": "Change of use from Use Class C3 (dwelling house) to a Class Sui Generis (HMO - house in multiple occupation) with associated amenity, cycle and refuse storage (RETROSPECTIVE).\r",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be implemented and maintained in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:\r\rLocation Plan\rProposed Ground Floor Plan - 23.23/06\rExisting Retrospective First Floor Plan - 23.26/08\rExisting Retrospective Loft Floor Plan - 23.26/09\rExisting Retrospective Roof Plan - 23.26/04\rExisting Retrospective Elevations Plan - 23.26/05\r\rOther documents submitted with the application\rHighways Proforma\rHighway Safety Impact Assessment\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The use of the property as a sui generis House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 8 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "No independent cooking or laundry facilities shall be installed in any of the respective bedrooms and the communal kitchen and living room shall be retained in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r"
  ],
